{
 "_comment": "Registry for _tools/update_pipeline.py. Every _tools/*.py script is classified here; `audit` fails on an unclassified script, so a new generator from a merged branch is added in ONE place: the `scripts` list below. class: generator (writes site files) | checker | report | investigation | library. tier: core (data/ only, run by regen) | assets (needs a WdExtract pass; run only when its extract output exists) | manual (needs inputs the pipeline cannot make: old scratch dumps, the Season 1 export, exe analysis). write/check are argument lists ({dump}, {png}, {files}, {out} are filled from the extract tree); null means the script has no such mode. ads_*.py are one person's local files and are ignored.",
 "version": 1,
